**Given** This audit file `02-spec/25-app-spec-audit/02-audit-2026-09-18-v2.md` was generated without modifying the audited source files.
**When** Validating that all 12 dimensions are scored with line-level evidence and that the overall score calculation adheres to the strict capping rule.
